# Secrets distribution workflow (suggestion)

When moving API keys into local env or hosting settings:

1. Inventory names from `.env.example` / project docs.
2. Unlock the human vault CLI; read **custom fields** (do not paste live secrets into chat).
3. Write ignored local env; generate local-only signing secrets when needed.
4. Push to the correct **org/team** hosting project; separate prod secrets from local.
5. List gaps (missing Client ID, account without key field, wrong vendor email).
6. Prefer a deploy-time secrets hub (e.g. Pulumi ESC) so host/matrix changes do not require retyping keys.

CLIs first; MCP when linked and useful. Full write-up: `suggestions/secrets-distribution-cli-mcp.md`.
